Original contributions of this repository
-----------------------------------------
The PPVC / FJSP-with-time-lags (FJSP-TL) extensions, the BCA-grounded benchmark
generator, and the evaluation/analysis pipeline are original to this repository
(see README.md for the file list). With every extension flag disabled, the code
reproduces the published DANIEL results bit-exactly.

